    <!-- Phase 1 widget rebuild — new mockup-specific chrome tokens (net worth / cash flow /
         recent activities richer tiers). These sit alongside the existing Aeon H-theme
         widget_* tokens above rather than replacing them: widget_positive/widget_negative
         keep doing income/expense tinting everywhere they already do, these are additive.
         widget_wall and widget_text_muted_alt were removed 2026-10-08: the Net Worth widget's
         own "wall" shell and its dark-text-on-light surface were a misreading of the design
         mockup (the mockup's dark background was the canvas/artboard page color, simulating a
         wallpaper behind several widget previews, not the widget's own chrome) — Net Worth now
         uses the already theme-adaptive widget_surface/widget_on_surface/widget_on_surface_variant
         tokens instead. widget_inner_surface/widget_accent_teal/widget_text_primary/
         widget_text_muted are still used by the Cash Flow / Recent Activities / Phase 2-3
         widgets currently shelved in shelved-widgets/ at the repo root — don't remove those
         without checking there first. -->
